{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45482","headline":"谢友人见访留诗 · 怀楚","name":"谢友人见访留诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轩车谁肯到，泉石自相亲。\n暮雨凋残寺，秋风怅望人。\n庭新一片叶，衣故十年尘。\n赖有瑶华赠，清吟愈病身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"怀楚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45482.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45482","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}